  "id": "autocratic",
  "term": "autocratic",
  "definition": "Autocratic refers to a leadership style in which a coach leads in a controlling, top-down way rather than sharing influence with athletes. In sport psychology, this style has been linked in Chinese sports research to athlete outcomes such as satisfaction and team cohesion, sometimes positively and sometimes negatively.",
